# No environment variables, database, or authentication secrets are required.
# This project exports a static, client-first frontend.
# Future NEXT_PUBLIC_* settings are public browser configuration, never secrets.
# BKK credentials belong only in the existing Cloudflare Worker's secrets.

# Optional public adapter URL for a static build. `bun run dev` sets the local
# adapter URL automatically; you do not need to copy this file for development.
# The adapter must allow the frontend origin and reach the official MÁV API.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EMMA_GRAPHQL_URL=https://your-approved-adapter.example/graphql
